@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title IFCOM+ — Registration lifecycle\nDRAFT 0.1 — proposed model for review

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
  StartColor #0F172A
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #D4A64B
  FontColor #44351A
}
hide empty description

state "Pending approval" as Pending #E8EFFA
state "Rejected" as Rejected #FFF0DB
state "Approved" as Approved #EFF6FF {
  state "No product history" as NoProducts #F1F5F9
  state "Has active products" as ActiveProducts #E7F4ED
  state "Awaiting closure" as Waiting #FFF5DE

  [*] --> NoProducts
  NoProducts -down-> ActiveProducts : LC-T04 first product activated\n[authorized and valid]
  ActiveProducts -down-> Waiting : LC-T05 last product deactivated\n/ set inactiveSince
  Waiting --> ActiveProducts : LC-T06 product activated or reactivated\n[allowed; before boundary]\n/ cancel current interval

  NoProducts : No deactivation anchor exists
  ActiveProducts : activeProductCount > 0
  Waiting : activeProductCount = 0
  Waiting : inactiveSince is known
}
state "Closed" as Closed #E2E8F0
Pending : Approval policy unresolved: OQ-003–OQ-005
Pending : A reminder does not change state
Rejected : PROPOSED: A-APR-001 / A-APR-002
Rejected : Resubmission not modeled yet
Closed : Terminated; record retained
Closed : Reopening not modeled yet

[*] --> Pending : LC-T01 / initialize accepted registration
Pending -down-> Approved : LC-T02 approve\n[authorized; policy permits]
Pending -right-> Rejected : LC-T03 reject\n[extension and policy permit]\n/ record decision and any required reason
Waiting -down-> Closed : LC-T07 automatic evaluation\n[closureEligible]

legend bottom
  All three inner phases retain status Approved; phase names are not database enums.
  LC-P02 proposes products after approval; LC-T06 cancellation/reset is also proposed.
  closureEligible = zero active products AND current interval AND one-year boundary reached.
  OQ-007 / OQ-012 remain open. No resubmission, import, restoration or deletion path is defined.
  Transition details: LC-T01–LC-T07 in docs/05-registration-lifecycle.md.
endlegend
@enduml
